<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62209" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεηλ-ᾰτέω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία,
		ἐλαύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive away
				booty</i>, esp. <i>cattle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				343
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				293
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.4.15
			</span></i>, al., Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				16.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.acc.loci,
				<i>plunder, despoil</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πεδίον,
				τὴν πόλιν, τὴν χώραν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.152
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				3.9.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
				16.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; <i>ravage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					2 iii 3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be plundered</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐκ τῆς χώρας λεηλατηθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					16.11
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γαστρὶ λεηλατεῖσθαι</span>
			<i>to be a slave to</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.133a
			</span></i>.</div>
